# Rhythm: method sheet on the adjudicated references (14 October 2026)

Twenty methods, four phases each, one truth (pooled adjudication, `<workshop>/rhythm/truth/<slug>.json`), leave-one-reference-out: the thresholds of a method are chosen on the OTHER references and applied to the held-out one, so every number below is a number on a video the method never saw. Scores are F1 at +-1 frame of the hard cuts (hard cuts only; transitions and ambiguous boundaries are neutral). FR : vingt methodes, quatre phases, verite adjudiquee, validation par reference exclue. (14 October 2026)

Phases: P1 the number per boundary, scored by the area under the ROC curve of true cuts against every boundary (AUC all) and against the judged traps (AUC traps); P2 peak picking; P3 persistence, flash return, isolation; P4 exact placement, F1 at 0 and at +-1 frame. (14 October 2026)

